# ...except the labels. 2.6KB of take/skip verdicts, and the one file here
# that nothing can regenerate: episodes and outcomes can be replayed from
# price history, but a judgement call cannot be. research/levels/ exists to
# capture judgement that lives nowhere in the codebase (see SCHEMA.md), and
# that file was being excluded by a rule written to keep 850MB of archived
# price data out of the repo.
!research/levels/data/labels.csv

